Chapter: BvtKeeperPlansOnce
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeStore
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-267 (trial-48864A: walled-in keepers ran a full-window plan in every hourly KEEPER line): the diagnostic plans run
 for a keeper's first report of a position and aim, not again for the same pair. Bits: 1 a first pair plans; 2 the same
 pair again does not; 4 a changed pair plans again. 7 is all.
  bkpo-checks : Integer -> Integer
  bkpo-checks (unused) =
    let buf = alloc-bytes 16
    in let z = poke-qword buf 8 0
    in let first = cs-plans-anew buf 8 41
    in let again = not (cs-plans-anew buf 8 41)
    in let moved = cs-plans-anew buf 8 42
    in (if first then 1 else 0) + (if again then 2 else 0) + (if moved then 4 else 0)
  bvt-keeper-plans-once : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-keeper-plans-once (unused) = act
    n <- bkpo-checks 0
    a <- bvt-check ("UOAIX-267 a walled-in keeper's report plans once per position and aim (code " & show n & ")") (n == 7)
    a
  end
